\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li270\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. O, my gracious Master
\par \pard\li270\sl186\slmult0  Look, I come to thee
\par  Thou did'st call me to come,
\par  and to your table
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  It is by thy compassion
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0   and in thy great love,
\par \pard\li270\sl186\slmult0  cleanse me, O, my Master,
\par  Let me dine with you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Jesus, through thy deep pain
\par \pard\li270\sl186\slmult0  and thy great suffering
\par  Thou gave up your whole life
\par  that I might be saved
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O, what kind of love is this?
\par  Thou art Son of God;
\par   I have sinned against you
\par   Jesus,  loveth me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.    Lord have mercy on me,
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0    forgive all my sins.
\par   By thine love thou was slain
\par \pard\li360\sl186\slmult0   and thou did arise.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  By this great redemption work,
\par    now I have my grace;
\par  a poor soul, I beg Thee
\par   have mercy on me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   The Holy communion gives eternal life
\par \pard\li360\sl186\slmult0 through that holiest action.
\par You gave us your flesh
\par Let it come to revive me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Throughout my life days
\par Till my troubles shall cease
\par \pard      In thy present home.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

